# Shortest direct-start race for start-only batches (#57): quits once the start lines and UDP Participants are in.
# Use with tools/sandbox_run.ps1 -Session "grand_prix f1_2025 <track> team=forceindia driver=stroll session=race" -Udp
@waitlog the player drives for forceindia as lance_stroll 300
@waitlog \[test\] screen garage_monitor_container 400
@sleep 8
pad a 700
@waitlog RaceStarts: Reaction Time for driver with vehicle id 60
# Participants comes about every 5 s
@sleep 12
status
